  (lib_symbols)
  (text "ARMED REAR HUB FUNCTIONAL NETLIST\n\n3S path: USB-C VBUS and CC resistors -> IP2326 3S charger -> protected 3S BMS -> VBAT (9.0 to 12.6 V).\n\nVBAT: DRV8871 VM, MP2315 3.3V buck, 5V buck for active buzzer and bridge.\n\nESP32: GPIO21 I2C_SDA, GPIO22 I2C_SCL, GPIO25 MPU INT / EXT0 wake, GPIO26 MOTOR_PH, GPIO27 MOTOR_EN.\n\nBridge: protected +5V, GND, 5V-to-3V3 RX divider, ESP32 TX, and 3V3 dead-man loop.\n\nBoard companion: armored_rear_hub.kicad_pcb has selected standard mechanical footprints, placement, high-current routes, holes, and RF keep-out."
